sort [g asc]
└─ project (g, n, max_r)
   └─ aggregate keys=[x.g] aggs=[count_0=count, max_0=max]
      └─ project (x.g, x.r)
         └─ filter (<= w_0 1000)
            └─ window partition=[big.g] order=[big.s asc, big.id asc] fns=[w_0=rank]
               └─ filter (<= __topk_0__ 1000)
                  └─ window partial partition=[big.g] order=[big.s asc, big.id asc] fns=[__topk_0__=rank]
                     └─ source big AS big (rows≈400 cost≈12.8K)
